---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Experiments"
  description="Interactive experiments and technical demonstrations by Raghib Hasan."
>
  <Fragment slot="heading">Experiments</Fragment>
  <p>Four experiments by <a href="https://raghib.io/">Raghib Hasan</a>. They run in your browser; imported sessions stay on your device.</p>
  <ul class="experiment-list" role="list">
    <li>
      <h2><a href="/session-flame/">Where Did the Time Go?</a></h2>
      <p>Replay a coding-agent session as a flame chart: prompts, model turns, tools, and sub-agents, with idle time folded away.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2><a href="/context-autopsy/">What’s Under the Prompt?</a></h2>
      <p>See what happens under the hood when you prompt: context growth, cache reuse, model calls, tools, and cost elsewhere.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2><a href="/token-diet/">Does Your Coding Agent Need a Token Diet?</a></h2>
      <p>Compare a coding agent’s token use across two rounds of recorded runs, with the reproduction kit and measurements.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2><a href="/chess/">Can a Browser Tab Beat You at Chess?</a></h2>
      <p>Play Stockfish compiled to WebAssembly. The engine runs on your device; no moves leave the page.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .experiment-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .experiment-list li {
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--theme-rule);
  }

  .experiment-list h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .experiment-list p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    color: var(--theme-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
</style>
